  "dct_title_s": "Infant Burial Activities, China, Pre-1796",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This point shapefile represents infant burial activities in China from 1644 to 1796. This layer was created as part of the Grave Reform in Modern China project, a digital humanities initiative based at Stanford that is building an interactive spatial and textual analysis platform to examine the phenomenon of grave relocation in modern China."
